Short:    FAME example door. Source included.
Uploader: strider@deadline.snafu.de (David Wettig)
Author:   strider@deadline.snafu.de (David Wettig)
Type:     comm/bbs

FAMEWHO.FIM is a FAME BBS door to replace the standard WHO door.

News:

 - On update argument "U" the internal FAME WHO of MainPart will be
   used instead of FAMEWHO.FIM.

 - Now FAMEWHO.FIM takes care of QuietNode, UserHide, RealUserHide,
   users level settings, AutoForceOnWho and the "FORCE" argument.

 - FAMEWHO.FIM checks for MainPart v1.13 minimum.
